<h1 data-copy-en="ARCHIE" data-copy-zh="ARCHIE">ARCHIE</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Unlock ARCHIE’s archive terminal, read records and use the record-view toggle." data-copy-zh="解锁ARCHIE的档案终端，阅读记录并使用档案视图切换。">Unlock ARCHIE’s archive terminal, read records and use the record-view toggle.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Archive_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Historical_Document_Topics"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Record_Toggle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_to_ARCHIE"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: ARCHIE — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/archie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="ARCHIE — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/archie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>ARCHIE — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>ARCHIE is an archive contact with terminal and record-reading functions. The useful progression is access to the archive, a successful terminal hack, then the available records.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Find ARCHIE at Archive Facility in the future Fringe Zone, all day. Ordinary conversation needs Known 25; the terminal action supplies the initial relationship boost.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Learn System Hacking, then use the archive terminal’s hack action:30 min/15 Energy. Success adds 25 direct affection once and unlocks the alternate record views.</p><p>Success chance is base Technology minus 20, plus 5 each for Data Mining and Digital Forensics, clamped to 5%–95%. Failure may lead to combat, so arrive prepared. These are base-stat checks, separate from ordinary modified-stat lesson requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to ARCHIE</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Archive Facility; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">25 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 80/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After success, use the small record-view icon near the upper-right corner: full color selects the unlocked records; grayscale selects the original records. Read the records in the archive menu; their contents are left for discovery.</p><p>Conversation takes 25 min and gives 1 base affection, up to 80/day. There is no separate date, romance chain or repeatable hacking reward.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If Talk is locked at first, use the location’s terminal action rather than looking for an earlier personal conversation.</li><li>Hacking succeeds only once for its relationship reward. Raising affection does not independently unlock the alternate archive view.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">Technology skills</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Future locations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progression</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Combat preparation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Archive_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Historical_Document_Topics"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Record_Toggle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_to_ARCHIE"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：ARCHIE 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/archie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="ARCHIE 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/archie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>ARCHIE 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>ARCHIE提供档案终端与记录阅读功能。实用进度为：进入档案设施、成功破解终端，再阅读已开放的记录。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>全天位于未来边缘区的档案设施。普通交谈要求已知25；终端行动提供首次关系提升。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先学会系统黑客，再使用档案终端的破解行动，消耗30分钟、15精力。成功后一次性增加25直接好感，并开放另一组档案视图。</p><p>成功率为基础科技减20；数据挖掘和数字取证各增加5个百分点，最终限制在5%–95%。失败可能进入战斗，出发前请做好准备。这是基础属性判定，与一般课程使用的加成后属性不同。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与ARCHIE交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">档案设施；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">25分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天80次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>成功后，可使用右上角附近的小图标切换记录：彩色显示新解锁的记录，灰色显示原有记录。具体内容留待在档案菜单中阅读。</p><p>交谈消耗25分钟、增加1基础好感，每天最多80次。目前没有独立约会、恋爱路线或可重复的破解奖励。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>首次交谈被锁时，使用地点的终端行动，不必寻找更早的个人谈话。</li><li>破解的关系奖励仅一次；单独提高好感不会开放另一组档案视图。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">科技技能</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">未来地点</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线进度</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">战斗准备</a></li></ul></section>
